  <VQE_GeothermalArcSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] has taken control of an abandoned geothermal ARC site. The camp is under the control of [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] is requesting that we clear out the area by eliminating all enemies and defenses. Securing the site will allow us to study the geothermal ARC and recover valuable components for future use. Additionally, [sitePart0_description].-->
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] has taken control of an abandoned geothermal ARC site. The camp is under the control of [siteFaction_name].\n\n[asker_nameDef] is requesting that we clear out the area by eliminating all enemies and defenses. Securing the site will allow us to study the geothermal ARC and recover valuable components for future use. Additionally, [sitePart0_description].</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We have received information that an old geothermal ARC site has been occupied by [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] from [siteFaction_name]. The bandits have fortified their position and are using the site to control the surrounding area.\n\nSecuring the site will give us access to study the geothermal ARC and extract useful components. The site is likely well-defended, so prepare for resistance. Additionally, [sitePart0_description].-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;We have received information that an old geothermal ARC site has been occupied by [siteFaction_pawnsPlural] from [siteFaction_name]. The bandits have fortified their position and are using the site to control the surrounding area.\n\nSecuring the site will give us access to study the geothermal ARC and extract useful components. The site is likely well-defended, so prepare for resistance. Additionally, [sitePart0_description].</li>
